WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:09.317
I couldn't wait to eat.

2
00:00:09.318 --> 00:00:14.377
I was so hungry!

3
00:00:14.378 --> 00:00:16.533
Waiter: Would you like anything else?

4
00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:18.276
Sunny: Just a minute, please.

5
00:00:18.277 --> 00:00:22.013
Hana and Bada, do you want anything else?

6
00:00:22.014 --> 00:00:27.261
Bada: I want the sweet thing with beef.

7
00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:28.748
Sunny: What is that?

8
00:00:28.749 --> 00:00:31.675
Hana: He means sweet and sour beef.

9
00:00:31.676 --> 00:00:33.577
Sunny: Oh, I see.

10
00:00:33.578 --> 00:00:37.799
Would you like that too, Hana?

11
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.186
Hana: I don't mind, Aunt Sunny.

12
00:00:40.187 --> 00:00:41.881
I am hungry.

13
00:00:41.882 --> 00:00:49.149
Sunny: Okay, okay. A dish of sweet and sour beef, please.

14
00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.708
Waiter: Yes, ma'am. Would you like anything to drink?

15
00:00:52.709 --> 00:00:54.857
Sunny: Some cold water, please.

16
00:00:54.858 --> 00:00:57.841
Hana: May I have cold water too?

17
00:00:57.842 --> 00:01:00.571
Waiter: Sure.

18
00:01:00.572 --> 00:01:03.965
Tom: I would like a glass of house wine, please.

19
00:01:03.966 --> 00:01:08.225
Waiter: Yes, sir.

20
00:01:08.226 --> 00:01:13.136
Bada: Mom, may I have a Coke, please?

21
00:01:13.137 --> 00:01:16.657
Mom: Alright, Bada. Just this one time.

22
00:01:16.658 --> 00:01:20.346
Bada: Yes! I would like a Coke, please.

23
00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:24.095
Waiter: Right away!

24
00:01:24.096 --> 00:01:26.660
Bada loves soft drinks.

25
00:01:26.661 --> 00:01:35.033
They're not good for your teeth, you know!
